 Impact: If successful, this tactic can significantly disrupt the debtor’s market standing, leading to revenue loss and strained relationships with suppliers and clients.";}i:2;i:6013;}i:44;a:3:{i:0;s:6:"p_open";i:1;a:0:{}i:2;i:6013;}i:45;a:3:{i:0;s:5:"cdata";i:1;a:1:{i:0;s:154:"Preventive Measures and Safeguards
